        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana FP40, Solid Brass 4 Inch Rectangular Flush Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 4\" rectangular recessed pulls can be used on amy door where a flush installation (pull Flush with the Doors Face) is required like on sliding pocket doors or barn doors. The Deltana FP40 flush pulls are available in 12 finishes including polished nickel, satin nickel, satin brass, oil rubbed bronze, and matte black. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/deltana-FP40-size.gif?v=1704354514\" width=\"600\" height=\"320\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Deltana FP40 4 Inch Rectangular Flush Pull Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: Larger <a href=\"/products/7-inch-rectangular-flush-pull-deltana-fp7178\"><b>7 Inch Rectangular Flush Pull</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/10-inch-rectangular-flush-pull-deltana-fp10225\"><b>10 Inch Rectangular Flush Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana FP40 4 Inch recessed Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Overall Height: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Width: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Depth: 7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3/32\" (.085)</li>\r\n<li>Inside Opening Height: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Inside Opening Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Cut-Out Height: 3-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Cut-Out Width: 1-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Inside Finger Lip: 1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Screw:  #3 x 5/8\" wood screw.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with matching finish screws.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FP40.pdf?v=1704262365\"><b>Deltana FP40 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</a></b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "4 Inch Rectangular Flush Pull, Deltana FP40",
                "description": "Deltana FP40 - The 4 inch rectangular recessed pulls can be used on amy door where a flush installation (pull Flush with the Doors Face) is required like on sliding pocket doors or barn doors. The Deltana FP40 flush pulls are available in 12 finishes including polished nickel, satin nickel, satin brass, oil rubbed bronze, and matte black. ",
